WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.128
"Does the bridal makeup shop also do makeup for the wedding parents?"

2
00:00:07.464 --> 00:00:14.448
On the wedding day, if the bride and groom are the stars, the wedding parents are the hosts who give the ceremony its dignity — the face of the wedding.

3
00:00:14.784 --> 00:00:21.576
But often, the bride books the same shop for her wedding makeup and for both sets of parents.

4
00:00:21.912 --> 00:00:24.552
That can certainly be convenient.

5
00:00:24.888 --> 00:00:28.296
But there's something worth thinking about here.

6
00:00:28.632 --> 00:00:34.896
At a shop that specializes in bridal makeup, who does the head artist actually work on the wedding day?

7
00:00:35.232 --> 00:00:38.160
Right — the bride, the star of the day.

8
00:00:38.496 --> 00:00:41.568
The chance they personally handle the wedding parents is very low.

9
00:00:41.904 --> 00:00:48.648
In the end, the wedding parents are usually left to weekend part-timers or inexperienced staff — that's the harsh reality of the industry.

10
00:00:48.984 --> 00:00:52.128
With wedding-parent makeup, who does it is everything.

11
00:00:52.464 --> 00:01:02.088
Unlike a bride in her 20s or 30s with firm, elastic skin, parents in their 50s and 60s deal with sagging skin, thinning hair, and finer strands — that calls for a completely different kind of expertise.

12
00:01:02.424 --> 00:01:08.880
Only a specialist who understands middle-aged skin and hair can deliver truly polished wedding-parent makeup.

13
00:01:09.216 --> 00:01:12.912
On the wedding day, the parents are the first impression of the whole ceremony.

14
00:01:13.248 --> 00:01:18.960
A place where the head artist and skilled professionals, who truly understand middle-aged skin, handle the parents themselves —

15
00:01:19.296 --> 00:01:23.424
that's the single most important criterion for choosing wedding-parent makeup.

16
00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:31.416
A shop that specializes in wedding parents gives each parent the same full attention a bride gets, completing their makeup and hair with total focus.

17
00:01:31.752 --> 00:01:34.008
The results are bound to be different, aren't they?

18
00:01:34.344 --> 00:01:40.272
If you want to feel your most confident as a wedding parent, choose a specialist where the parents are the stars.

19
00:01:40.608 --> 00:01:48.576
Instead of a shop shared with the bride, finding one where a professional personally handles the parents is the secret to great wedding-parent makeup.
